flowchart LR
    A[Input text] --> B[Runner: split]
    B --> C[(Redis task queue)]
    C --> W1[Map worker 1]
    C --> W2[Map worker 2]
    C --> W3[Map worker 3]
    W1 --> D[(Redis mapped results)]
    W2 --> D
    W3 --> D
    D --> E[Runner: shuffle by key]
    E --> F[Runner: reduce sums]
    F --> G[Word frequencies]
